5><c>safer </c><00:00:08.986><c>43.5 </c><00:00:08.987><c>degree </c><00:00:08.988><c>angle  </c><00:00:08.989><c>subsequently </c><00:00:08.990><c>egyptian </c><00:00:08.991><c>builders </c><00:00:08.992><c>must </c><00:00:08.993><c>have  </c><00:00:08.994><c>determined </c><00:00:08.995><c>that </c><00:00:08.996><c>the </c><00:00:08.997><c>fundamental </c><00:00:08.998><c>cause </c><00:00:08.999><c>of  </c><00:00:09.000><c>the </c><00:00:09.001><c>mydom </c><00:00:09.002><c>collapse </c><00:00:09.003><c>was </c><00:00:09.004><c>its </c><00:00:09.005><c>unsound  </c><00:00:09.006><c>foundations  </c><00:00:09.007><c>because </c><00:00:09.008><c>all </c><00:00:09.009><c>subsequent </c><00:00:09.010><c>pyramids </c><00:00:09.011><c>were  </c><00:00:09.012><c>built </c><00:00:09.013><c>at </c><00:00:09.014><c>the </c><00:00:09.015><c>original </c><00:00:09.016><c>52 </c><00:00:09.017><c>degree </c><00:00:09.018><c>angle  </c><00:00:09.019><c>but </c><00:00:09.020><c>they </c><00:00:09.021><c>were </c><00:00:09.022><c>founded </c><00:00:09.023><c>on </c><00:00:09.024><c>solid </c><00:00:09.025><c>bedrock  </c><00:00:09.026><c>so </c><00:00:09.027><c>is </c><00:00:09.028><c>mendelson's </c><00:00:09.029><c>theory </c><00:00:09.030><c>correct </c><00:00:09.031><c>we'll  </c><00:00:09.032><c>probably </c><00:00:09.033><c>never </c><00:00:09.034><c>know  </c><00:00:09.035><c>but </c><00:00:09.036><c>it's </c><00:00:09.037><c>entirely </c><00:00:09.038><c>plausible </c><00:00:09.039><c>and </c><00:00:09.040><c>it  </c><00:00:09.041><c>certainly </c><00:00:09.042><c>demonstrates  </c><00:00:09.043><c>once </c><00:00:09.044><c>again </c><00:00:09.045><c>that </c><00:00:09.046><c>an </c><00:00:09.047><c>engineering  </c><00:00:09.048><c>perspective </c><00:00:09.049><c>opens </c><00:00:09.050><c>the </c><00:00:09.051><c>door </c><00:00:09.052><c>to </c><00:00:09.053><c>new  </c><00:00:09.054><c>insights </c><00:00:09.055><c>about </c><00:00:09.056><c>our </c><00:00:09.057><c>w